						let
						    // 1. Call the parameter (assuming it is exactly named "Date From")
						    Source = #"Data From",
						    
						    // 2. Convert that single value into a table so DAX can see it
						    ConvertedToTable = Table.FromValue(Source),
						    
						    // 3. (Optional) Rename the column to "Value" for easy DAX referencing
						    RenamedColumns = Table.RenameColumns(ConvertedToTable,{{"Value", "Earliest Date"}})
						in
						    RenamedColumns
						```

