			measure '57 - Selected Retail Price' = ```
					
					// 1. Filter for in-stock products
					VAR _InStockProducts = 
					    FILTER (
					        '42 - Product',
					        [57 - Stock On Hand (Remove Filter)] > 0
					    )
					--'42 - Product'[Product Model]
					// 2. Calculate ONLY the Max price against the filtered stock
					VAR _MaxPrice = CALCULATE ( MAX('42 - Product'[Retail Price]), _InStockProducts )
					
					// 4. Lock scope to the Product Model
					RETURN
					    IF (
					        ISINSCOPE('42 - Product'[Product Model]) || ISINSCOPE('42 - Product'[Product Group ID])|| ISINSCOPE('42 - Product'[Clean Product Name]),
					        _MaxPrice
					    )
					```
